# Supports whitespace-separated and pipe-separated table examples.
Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value TRUST_STATE (\S+)
Value RATE_PPS (\S+)
Value BURST_INTERVAL (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*${INTERFACE}\s+${TRUST_STATE}\s+${RATE_PPS}\s+${BURST_INTERVAL}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*${INTERFACE}\s+${TRUST_STATE}\s+${RATE_PPS}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*${INTERFACE}\s*\|\s*${TRUST_STATE}\s*\|\s*${RATE_PPS}\s*$$ -> Record
